{"title":"Texas mathematics competitions","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Texas_Mathematics_Competitions\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Texas Mathematics Competitions</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Texas_Middle_School_Mathematics_Competitions\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Texas Middle School Mathematics Competitions</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Texas_High_School_Mathematics_Competitions\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Texas High School Mathematics Competitions</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#National_Math_Contests\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">National Math Contests</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Categories\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Categories</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h1><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Texas_Mathematics_Competitions\">Texas Mathematics Competitions</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Texas_mathematics_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Texas Mathematics Competitions\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h1>\n<p>The state of Texas is home to numerous mathematics competitions at both the middle and high school levels, offering students a chance to develop and showcase their problem-solving skills. Here is a list of notable competitions in Texas:\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Texas_Middle_School_Mathematics_Competitions\">Texas Middle School Mathematics Competitions</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Texas_mathematics_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Texas Middle School Mathematics Competitions\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>These competitions are geared toward middle school students and help prepare them for higher-level contests:\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Texas_MathCounts\" title=\"Texas MathCounts\">Texas MathCounts</a> is part of the national <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=MathCounts\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"MathCounts\">MathCounts</a> competition.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Texas_A%26M_University_Math_Contest&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Texas A&amp;M University Math Contest (page does not exist)\">Texas A&amp;M University Math Contest</a> (<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.math.tamu.edu/teaching/undergrad/highschoolcontest/\">website</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Texas_Alliance_for_Minorities_in_Engineering_State_Math_Contest&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Texas Alliance for Minorities in Engineering State Math Contest (page does not exist)\">Texas Alliance for Minorities in Engineering State Math Contest</a> (<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.engr.utexas.edu/tame/new_site/programs/math%20science/2004/mathscienceinfo04.html\">website</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=University_of_Houston_Math_Tournament&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"University of Houston Math Tournament (page does not exist)\">University of Houston Math Tournament</a> (<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://mathcontest.uh.edu/\">website</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Beestar_Math_Competition\" title=\"Beestar Math Competition\">Beestar Math Competition</a> (<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://beestar.org/?adid=105\">website</a> Register NOW)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Texas_Math_and_Science_Coaches_Association_(TMSCA)&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Texas Math and Science Coaches Association (TMSCA) (page does not exist)\">Texas Math and Science Coaches Association (TMSCA)</a> (<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.tmsca.org/\">website</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Texas_Charter_Schools_Academic_and_Athletic_League_(TCSAAL)&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Texas Charter Schools Academic and Athletic League (TCSAAL) (page does not exist)\">Texas Charter Schools Academic and Athletic League (TCSAAL)</a> (<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://texascharter.rsportz.com/\">website</a>)</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Texas_High_School_Mathematics_Competitions\">Texas High School Mathematics Competitions</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Texas_mathematics_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Texas High School Mathematics Competitions\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>High school students in Texas also have access to a variety of math competitions, which often serve as preparation for national-level contests:\n</p>\n<ul><li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://houston.integirls.org/\">INTEGIRLS Houston</a> (<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://houston.integirls.org/\">website</a>)</li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.math.tamu.edu/outreach/highschoolcontest/\">Texas A&amp;M University Math Contest</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://mathcontest.uh.edu/\">University of Houston Math Tournament</a> (<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://mathcontest.uh.edu/\">website</a>)</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"National_Math_Contests\">National Math Contests</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Texas_mathematics_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: National Math Contests\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For students interested in competing beyond the state level, there are several prestigious national mathematics competitions:\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=List_of_United_States_elementary_school_mathematics_competitions\" title=\"List of United States elementary school mathematics competitions\">List of United States elementary school mathematics competitions</a> for national contests.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=List_of_United_States_middle_school_mathematics_competitions\" title=\"List of United States middle school mathematics competitions\">List of United States middle school mathematics competitions</a> for national contests.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=List_of_United_States_high_school_mathematics_competitions\" title=\"List of United States high school mathematics competitions\">List of United States high school mathematics competitions</a> for national contests.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Texas_mathematics_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=List_of_Mathematics_Competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"List of Mathematics Competitions (page does not exist)\">List of Mathematics Competitions</a>: A comprehensive list of various mathematics competitions around the world.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathematics_Competitions_Resources&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Mathematics Competitions Resources (page does not exist)\">Mathematics Competitions Resources</a>: A collection of resources to help students prepare for and succeed in math competitions.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Categories\">Categories</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Texas_mathematics_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Categories\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017202548\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.017 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.031 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 30/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:1433:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017202548 and revision id 280381. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}